{"unit_id":"Def1ce__dsh-lan-bridge#feature-1","repo":"Def1ce/dsh-lan-bridge","commit":"f665f8ccaf4cf69883387dea8ba095bd3b3cedd9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-bridge 的功能「网页 UUID 补丁」：插件为 DSH 返回的 HTML 注入 randomUUID polyfill，供页面脚本调用，并使用 getRandomValues 生成 UUID。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:21-29","dsh/index.js:36-43"]}
{"unit_id":"Def1ce__dsh-lan-bridge#feature-2","repo":"Def1ce/dsh-lan-bridge","commit":"f665f8ccaf4cf69883387dea8ba095bd3b3cedd9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-bridge 的功能「独立 HTTP 代理」：CLI 将指定本机 Web 后端转发到配置的 HTTP 监听端口。通过 --backend 和 --http-port 设置地址与端口，浏览器请求由代理转发并返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/dsh-bridge.cjs:12-27","bin/dsh-bridge.cjs:56-89","bin/dsh-bridge.cjs:118-125"]}
{"unit_id":"Def1ce__dsh-lan-bridge#feature-3","repo":"Def1ce/dsh-lan-bridge","commit":"f665f8ccaf4cf69883387dea8ba095bd3b3cedd9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-bridge 的功能「WebSocket 转发」：独立代理收到协议升级请求后连接后端，并在客户端与后端之间双向传递数据，供网页实时通道使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/dsh-bridge.cjs:91-113"]}
{"unit_id":"Def1ce__dsh-lan-bridge#feature-4","repo":"Def1ce/dsh-lan-bridge","commit":"f665f8ccaf4cf69883387dea8ba095bd3b3cedd9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-bridge 的功能「代理参数配置」：启动 CLI 时可指定后端 URL、监听 HTTP 端口和绑定地址；未指定时使用代码中的默认值。传入 --help 可查看选项说明。","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/dsh-bridge.cjs:12-27","bin/dsh-bridge.cjs:30-45"]}
{"unit_id":"Def1ce__dsh-lan-bridge#caveat-1","repo":"Def1ce/dsh-lan-bridge","commit":"f665f8ccaf4cf69883387dea8ba095bd3b3cedd9","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lan-bridge 使用前须知：独立代理需要 Node.js 18 以上；默认连接本机 3080 并监听 8088，启动参数可修改（见 bin/dsh-bridge.cjs:12-27）。","source":"generated","evidence":["package.json:24-25","bin/dsh-bridge.cjs:12-27"]}
